      "operationId": "observe-effective-policy",
      "source": "Release-owned projection of cached RSoP WMI, local NetAPI, Audit Policy, LSA Policy, Windows Security Center, approved Defender cmdlets, ActiveStore firewall state, BitLocker status, Win32_DeviceGuard state, structured WDAC inventory, separate AppLocker GP and CSP channels, and exact local registry values",
